      }
    },
    "For a longer text, press the talk key twice quickly and talk hands free. Press it once more to paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要说长一点的内容，可以快速连按两下说话键，松开后继续说。说完再按一下，文字就会粘贴进去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a meeting in two languages. Live captions show what the other side says in your language, and Orra can speak your translated words to them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适用于两种语言的会议。实时字幕用你的语言显示对方说的话，Orra 也可以把你说的话译好后朗读给对方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
