    "Not Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Numbers spoken in Chinese, such as dates, times, prices and percentages, are written as digits. Small counts, rough numbers and idioms stay in words." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说出来的日期、时间、价格和百分比会写成阿拉伯数字。“三本书”这样的小数目、“十几个”这样的约数和成语保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the on screen hint: nothing shows at the bottom of the screen",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On an external keyboard, right Control works best, because some, such as the Logitech MX Keys, never send fn. On a Mac's built in keyboard, fn (Globe) at the bottom left is comfortable while your right hand is on the mouse." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在外接键盘上，右侧 Control 键最合适，因为有些外接键盘（比如 Logitech MX Keys）的 fn 键信号根本传不到 Mac。在 Mac 自带的键盘上，左下角的 fn（地球仪）键在右手用鼠标时也很顺手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On screen hint" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac's own keyboard, fn (Globe) at the bottom left is comfortable while your right hand is on the mouse. On an external keyboard, choose right Control, because some, such as the Logitech MX Keys, never send fn." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这台 Mac 自带的键盘上，左下角的 fn（地球仪）键在右手用鼠标时很顺手。用外接键盘时请选右侧 Control 键，因为有些外接键盘（比如 Logitech MX Keys）的 fn 键信号根本传不到 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only while dictating" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在听写时显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only while ready" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the on screen hint, offered only to someone who kept the idle bar and turned the recording indicator off",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在待命时显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open at Login" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录时打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Microphone Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开麦克风设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Sound Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开声音设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Options…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original and translation" : {
      "comment" : "A display mode of the caption window, each sentence with its translation",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原文和译文逐句对照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra also speaks what the translation key translated, into the device below, so the other side of a call hears it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 还会把翻译键翻译的内容说到下面的设备中，让通话的另一方听到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra can use the microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 可以使用麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra changes your clipboard only when you choose Copy Report, or when your text is too long for the link." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有在你选择“拷贝报告”，或者你的内容太长、链接放不下时，Orra 才会改动剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not add itself to Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法将自己添加到登录项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not capture the sound the Mac plays. Turn Live Captions off and on again to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法捕获 Mac 播放的声音。请关闭“实时字幕”后再打开，重试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not download the model from Hugging Face or its mirrors." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法从 Hugging Face 或其镜像下载模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not listen to the voice sample. Choose it again once the speech model is ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法听取声音样本。请在语音模型就绪后重新选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not play into %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法向 %@ 播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not read this audio file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法读取这个音频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not remove itself from Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法将自己从登录项中移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra could not save the model files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 无法存储模型文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra does not paste into password fields. Use Copy Last Dictation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 不会粘贴到密码栏。请使用“拷贝上次听写”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra heard no speech in the voice sample." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 在声音样本中没有听到语音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra is always in the menu bar. While this is off, it shows in the Dock only while one of its windows is open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 始终在菜单栏中。关闭此项后，只有在 Orra 的窗口打开时，程序坞里才会显示它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra is ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 已准备就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra needs it to notice the talk key and to paste the text. Turn on Orra in the list that opens, then come back here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 需要它来识别说话键并粘贴文字。请在打开的列表中打开 Orra，然后回到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra needs its speech model to transcribe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 需要语音模型才能转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra never learns corrections from a translated paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 不会从翻译后粘贴的文字中学习更正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra never speaks into the speakers on its own. Without Orra Microphone, pick a device here, such as a loopback device a meeting app can use as its microphone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 不会自行通过扬声器说话。没有 Orra Microphone 时，请在这里选择一个设备，例如会议应用可以用作麦克风的环回设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra opens the folder with the report file. Drag the file into the page on GitHub." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 会打开报告文件所在的文件夹，请把文件拖进 GitHub 页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra records only while you hold the talk key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 只在你按住说话键时录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra records up to 1 minute at a time, so the recording stopped there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 每次最多录 1 分钟，所以录音到这里就停止了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra shows the new language after it restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 重新启动后才会显示新的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orra's speech model listens to each sentence before it plays, and makes it again when it hears other words. Each sentence starts a moment later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每句话播放前，Orra 会先用语音模型听一遍，听到的字词不对就重新合成。每句话会稍晚一点开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Page Down" : {
      "comment" : "A key name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Page Down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Page Up" : {
      "comment" : "A key name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Page Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste Original Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "粘贴原文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste Original Text in the Orra menu brings back the text from before the translation, and Copy Last Dictation copies the translation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orra 菜单中的“粘贴原文”可以找回翻译之前的文字，“拷贝上次听写”拷贝的是译文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已暂停"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People, products and terms you use. Orra gives them to the speech model so it writes them your way. They stay on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你常用的人名、产品名和术语。Orra 会把它们交给语音模型，让它按你的写法输出。这些词只保存在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play sounds when recording starts and stops" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开始和停止录音时播放提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing the speech model…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在准备语音模型…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按%@结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ to talk, and again to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按%@说话，再按一下结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ to translate, and again to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按%@翻译，再按一下结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ twice to talk, and once more to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连按两下%@说话，再按一下结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press %@ twice to translate, and once more to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连按两下%@翻译，再按一下结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a key or a combination" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下一个键或一组组合键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press a key or a combination. Use fn, Control, Option or Command on its own, or a combination such as ⌃ ⌥ or ⇧ ⌘ D. Escape cancels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下一个键或一组组合键。请单独按 fn、Control、Option 或 Command 键，或者按一组组合键，例如 ⌃ ⌥ 或 ⇧ ⌘ D。按 Esc 键取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the key once to start, and once more to paste. Escape cancels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按一下这个键开始，再按一下粘贴。按 Esc 键取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the key twice quickly to start, and once more to paste. Escape cancels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速连按两下这个键开始，再按一下粘贴。按 Esc 键取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the talk key twice quickly and Orra keeps recording after you let go. Press the key once more to paste, or Escape to cancel. Holding the key works as before." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速连按两下说话键，松开后 Orra 会继续录音。再按一下说话键就会粘贴，按 Esc 键则取消。按住说话的用法不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press the talk key twice quickly to keep recording after you let go." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速连按两下说话键，松开后继续录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press to start and stop" : {
      "comment" : "A trigger mode: press once to start and once more to stop",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按一下开始，再按一下结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit Orra" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出 Orra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qwen3-TTS starts speaking sooner. CosyVoice3 sounds more like the voice sample and needs a larger download." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qwen3-TTS 开口更快。CosyVoice3 更像声音样本，但下载更大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the field you dictated into for 3 minutes after a paste and adds a misheard word you fix to your vocabulary." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "粘贴后 3 分钟内读取你听写的输入框，把你改正的听错的词加入个人词库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recently used" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended: fn on a Mac's built in keyboard, right Control on an external keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推荐：Mac 自带键盘用 fn 键，外接键盘用右侧 Control 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove %lld Words" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除 %lld 个词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove filler words such as um and uh" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去掉“呃”“嗯”这类语气词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes fillers and applies spoken self corrections, such as “三点，哦不对，四点”. It needs a %@ download and about 4 GB of memory, adds under a second to a short dictation and more to a long one, and runs on this Mac. Paste Original Text in the Orra menu brings back the text from before the cleanup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去掉语气词，并按你说出口的更正改好内容，比如“三点，哦不对，四点”。需要下载 %@，约占 4 GB 内存，短的听写多花不到 1 秒，长的更久，全部在这台 Mac 上运行。Orra 菜单中的“粘贴原文”可以找回整理之前的文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes um, uh and erm where they only fill a pause, and the same sounds in Chinese. Words that carry meaning stay as you said them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去掉只用来停顿的“呃”“额”“嗯”“啊”“哦”，英文里的同类词也会去掉。有意义的词，比如“好啊”“吧”“那个”，以及“嗯，好的”这样的回答，会照原样保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report a Problem" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report a Problem…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告问题…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports go to GitHub and are public, so leave out private details. You need a free GitHub account. If you are not signed in, GitHub asks you to sign in or to create an account. After you sign in, GitHub shows the form with your text filled in. After creating an account, choose Continue on GitHub again if the form is empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告会发到 GitHub 上并公开显示，请不要写入隐私信息。你需要一个免费的 GitHub 账户。如果你没有登录，GitHub 会请你登录或注册账户。登录后，GitHub 会显示已填好你的内容的表单。注册账户后，如果表单是空的，请再选择一次“在 GitHub 上继续”。"
          }
