    },
    "The microphone could not start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "麦克风无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone needs permission" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "麦克风需要权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model comes from Hugging Face or a mirror. Your speech stays on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型来自 Hugging Face 或其镜像。你的语音只留在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model comes from Hugging Face or a mirror. Your text stays on this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型来自 Hugging Face 或其镜像。你的文字只留在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording could not be transcribed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法转写这段录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保存报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be saved. Try again, or turn off Attach the diagnostic report to go on without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保存报告。请再试一次，或关闭“附上诊断报告”，不附报告继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules run on every dictation, with or without the local model, and before it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次听写都会应用这些规则，不论是否打开本地模型，而且在模型之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model could not be loaded" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法载入语音模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is not on this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上没有语音模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is not ready. Captions start once it is loaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音模型尚未就绪。载入后字幕就会开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is not ready. The Orra menu shows what is missing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音模型尚未就绪。Orra 菜单里会显示缺少什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音模型已就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model is still loading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音模型仍在载入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The talk key can be fn, Control, Option or Command on the left or right, or a combination." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说话键可以用 fn 键，左侧、右侧的 Control、Option、Command 键，或者一组组合键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The talk key needs Accessibility access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说话键需要辅助功能权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation key can be fn, Control, Option or Command on the left or right, or a combination. Pick the talk key and the two keys swap." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译键可以用 fn 键，左侧、右侧的 Control、Option、Command 键，或者一组组合键。选了说话键的话，两个键会互换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The translation key waits a moment before it records, so its shortcuts and the characters Option types keep working. With Double press for hands free on, press it twice quickly to translate hands free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译键要按住片刻才开始录音，所以它的快捷键和 Option 键输入的字符照常可用。打开“连按两下进入免手持模式”后，快速连按两下翻译键，就能免手持翻译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two keys swapped. The talk key is now %@ and the translation key %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The two keys swapped. The talk key is now %1$@ and the translation key %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两个键已互换。现在说话键是%1$@，翻译键是%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice model could not be downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音合成模型无法下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice model could not be loaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音合成模型无法载入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice model could not speak this translation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音合成模型无法说出这条译文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice model failed twice on a sentence, so Orra skipped it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音合成模型两次都没能说好一句话，所以 Orra 跳过了这一句。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice model is not on this Mac yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上还没有语音合成模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice sample must be at least %lld seconds long." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音样本至少要有 %lld 秒长。"
