    },
    "Translation key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation key mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译键用法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation Key: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译键：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation only" : {
      "comment" : "A display mode of the caption window",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只显示译文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation uses the local model of Clean Up Text on this Mac, with about 4 GB of memory, also while cleanup is off. A dictation that is too long, or a translation that fails Orra's checks, is pasted as you said it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "翻译在这台 Mac 上使用“整理文字”的本地模型，约占 4 GB 内存，即使整理文字关闭也能用。听写太长，或者译文没通过 Orra 的检查时，会按原话粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it in any app: hold the talk key, say something, and let go. The text appears where you are typing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在任何 App 中试试：按住说话键，说点什么，然后松开。文字会出现在你正在输入的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Translation to use this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开翻译后才能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Translation under Features to use this key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“功能”里打开“翻译”后才能使用这个键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a word or name, then press Return" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入一个词或名字，按回车添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up Arrow" : {
      "comment" : "A key name",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上箭头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a recording of your own voice only. Orra writes down what the voice sample says with its speech model, keeps both in memory until it quits and never saves them. The other side hears a synthesized voice, so let them know." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只使用你自己声音的录音。Orra 会用语音模型写下声音样本里说的话，并把两者只保存在内存中，直到退出，从不存储到磁盘。对方听到的是合成的声音，请告诉他们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use fn, Control, Option or Command on its own, or a combination such as ⌃ ⌥ or ⇧ ⌘ D. Escape cancels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请单独按 fn、Control、Option 或 Command 键，或者按一组组合键，例如 ⌃ ⌥ 或 ⇧ ⌘ D。按 Esc 键取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vocabulary" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人词库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vocabulary is full, so “%@” was not added" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人词库已满，没有加入“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice model" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语音合成模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice sample" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音样本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Orra" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎使用 Orra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happened?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发生了什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you did, what you expected, and what happened instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你做了什么，预期的结果是什么，实际发生了什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is on, Orra reads the text of the field you dictated into for up to 3 minutes after each paste, while you are in that field, never a password field. When you fix a misheard word, Orra adds the right spelling to your vocabulary and shows a notice where you can undo it. Orra keeps only the word pairs, on this Mac. It works in apps that let macOS read their text, such as Notes, Mail and Safari, but not in some editors and terminals. There, copy the right word and add it from the Orra menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后，每次粘贴后的 3 分钟内，只要你还在那个输入框里，Orra 就会读取它的文字，从不读取密码框。你改正一个听错的词，Orra 就会把正确的写法加入个人词库，并弹出提示，你可以撤销。Orra 只保存词对，只存在这台 Mac 上。它只在 macOS 能读取文字的 App 里生效，比如备忘录、邮件和 Safari，部分编辑器和终端不行。在这些 App 里，请拷贝正确的词，再从 Orra 菜单里添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this microphone is not connected, Orra uses the system default. With the lid closed, a MacBook's own microphone is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个麦克风未连接时，Orra 使用系统默认输入。合上盖子时，MacBook 自带的麦克风会关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you dictate, white bars at the bottom of the screen move with your voice, and say why when nothing is pasted. Always also keeps a small bar there while Orra is ready, which shows how to talk when you point at it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听写时，屏幕底部的白色音量条随你的声音跳动，没有粘贴时会说明原因。选择“始终显示”时，Orra 待命时那里还会有一条小横条，指针移到上面会显示怎样说话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows key" : {
      "comment" : "The key a keyboard with a Windows layout has in place of Command",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "词语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write numbers as digits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把数字写成阿拉伯数字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this later in Settings, under General." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后也可以在“设置”的“通用”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your text was too long for the link, so GitHub shows only its start. The full text is on your clipboard. On GitHub, select all the text in the What happened box and paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的内容太长，链接放不下，所以 GitHub 只显示开头部分。完整内容已放到剪贴板上。请在 GitHub 上全选“发生了什么”框里的文字，再粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.3"
}
